<title>HONG KONG: Guangzhou Inv 1996 net rises 5.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Guangzhou Inv 1996 net rises 5.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   17.5	  vs 16.9</p>
<p>Dividend</p>
<p>(H.K. cents) 2.8 vs 2.8</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  125.43 gain vs 44.20 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    438.01	vs 415.04</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,620.84    vs 2,054.50</p>
<p>    Company name		 Guangzhou Investment Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 12-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 24</p>
<p>NOTE - Guangzhou Investment engages in property development and investment in Hong Kong, Macau and China and provides property management and consultancy services.</p>
<p>Exceptional item represents the profit arising from the disposal of the group's 25 percent interest in a subsidiary.</p>
<p>Total dividend for the year is 5.3 H.K. cents (including an interim dividend of 2.5 cents) vs 5.3 ents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
